From 58ccb243022041e3a4912a5b9eb8f80682615086 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:32:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace the modules removed in Cucumber-JVM 8.0.0

Cucumber-JVM 8.0.0 removed cucumber-openejb and cucumber-cdi2 in favor of
cucumber-jakarta-openejb and cucumber-jakarta-cdi, and removed
cucumber-deltaspike without a replacement. Swap the dependencies, point a
cucumber.object-factory property at the replacement object factory, and
flag cucumber-deltaspike.

Part of #63
---
 .../resources/META-INF/rewrite/cucumber.yml   |  35 ++++
 .../resources/META-INF/rewrite/recipes.csv    |   1 +
 .../ReplaceRemovedCucumber8ModulesTest.java   | 157 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 193 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/test/java/org/openrewrite/cucumber/jvm/ReplaceRemovedCucumber8ModulesTest.java

diff --git a/src/main/resources/META-INF/rewrite/cucumber.yml b/src/main/resources/META-INF/rewrite/cucumber.yml
index 8281537..6948e4e 100755
--- a/src/main/resources/META-INF/rewrite/cucumber.yml
+++ b/src/main/resources/META-INF/rewrite/cucumber.yml
@@ -516,3 +516,38 @@ recipeList:
       version: 1.9.x
       onlyIfUsing: org.junit.platform.suite.api.*
       acceptTransitive: true
+---
+type: specs.openrewrite.org/v1beta/recipe
+name: org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.ReplaceRemovedCucumber8Modules
+displayName: Replace modules removed in Cucumber-JVM 8.0.0
+description: >-
+  Cucumber-JVM 8.0.0 removed the `javax` based `cucumber-openejb` and `cucumber-cdi2` modules, in favor of the
+  `cucumber-jakarta-openejb` and `cucumber-jakarta-cdi` modules that have been published alongside them since 7.x.
+  Swaps the dependencies, keeping their version so they stay aligned with the other Cucumber modules, and points a
+  `cucumber.object-factory` property at the replacement object factory. `cucumber-deltaspike` was removed without a
+  replacement, so it is only flagged.
+tags:
+  - testing
+  - cucumber
+recipeList:
+  - org.openrewrite.java.dependencies.ChangeDependency:
+      oldGroupId: io.cucumber
+      oldArtifactId: cucumber-openejb
+      newArtifactId: cucumber-jakarta-openejb
+  - org.openrewrite.java.dependencies.ChangeDependency:
+      oldGroupId: io.cucumber
+      oldArtifactId: cucumber-cdi2
+      newArtifactId: cucumber-jakarta-cdi
+  - org.openrewrite.properties.ChangePropertyValue:
+      propertyKey: cucumber.object-factory
+      oldValue: io.cucumber.openejb.OpenEJBObjectFactory
+      newValue: io.cucumber.jakarta.openejb.OpenEJBObjectFactory
+      relaxedBinding: false
+  - org.openrewrite.properties.ChangePropertyValue:
+      propertyKey: cucumber.object-factory
+      oldValue: io.cucumber.cdi2.Cdi2Factory
+      newValue: io.cucumber.jakarta.cdi.CdiJakartaFactory
+      relaxedBinding: false
+  - org.openrewrite.java.dependencies.DependencyInsight:
+      groupIdPattern: io.cucumber
+      artifactIdPattern: cucumber-deltaspike
diff --git a/src/main/resources/META-INF/rewrite/recipes.csv b/src/main/resources/META-INF/rewrite/recipes.csv
index a4dee4d..70f4bf0 100644
--- a/src/main/resources/META-INF/rewrite/recipes.csv
+++ b/src/main/resources/META-INF/rewrite/recipes.csv
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ maven,org.openrewrite.recipe:rewrite-cucumber-jvm,org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.M
 maven,org.openrewrite.recipe:rewrite-cucumber-jvm,org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.MigrateScenarioWriteAndEmbed,Migrate `Scenario.write` and `Scenario.embed`,"Cucumber-JVM 6.0.0 removed `Scenario.write(String)` and `Scenario.embed(byte[], String)` along with `Scenario.embed(byte[], String, String)`, in favor of `Scenario.log(String)` and `Scenario.attach(byte[], String, String)`. The two argument `embed` emitted an attachment without a name, which `attach` expresses as a `null` name.",7,Cucumber-JVM,Cucumber,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber-JVM](https://github.com/cucumber/cucumber-jvm/).,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber](https://cucumber.io/).
 maven,org.openrewrite.recipe:rewrite-cucumber-jvm,org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.RegexToCucumberExpression,Replace `cucumber-java` step definition regexes with Cucumber expressions,Strip regex prefix and suffix from step annotation expressions arguments where possible.,1,Cucumber-JVM,Cucumber,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber-JVM](https://github.com/cucumber/cucumber-jvm/).,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber](https://cucumber.io/).
 maven,org.openrewrite.recipe:rewrite-cucumber-jvm,org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.RemoveCucumberJava8Dependency,Remove `cucumber-java8` once nothing is left needing it,"Removes the `cucumber-java8` dependency where every `LambdaGlue` call migrates to `cucumber-java`, and retains it wherever one is left behind. Read from the glue as it stands before the migration, as what the migration leaves behind only becomes visible to a scanning recipe in the cycle after, which a build tool run never reaches. Glue left anywhere retains the dependency everywhere, an unused dependency being the one outcome here that still compiles.",1,Cucumber-JVM,Cucumber,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber-JVM](https://github.com/cucumber/cucumber-jvm/).,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber](https://cucumber.io/).
+maven,org.openrewrite.recipe:rewrite-cucumber-jvm,org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.ReplaceRemovedCucumber8Modules,Replace modules removed in Cucumber-JVM 8.0.0,"Cucumber-JVM 8.0.0 removed the `javax` based `cucumber-openejb` and `cucumber-cdi2` modules, in favor of the `cucumber-jakarta-openejb` and `cucumber-jakarta-cdi` modules that have been published alongside them since 7.x. Swaps the dependencies, keeping their version so they stay aligned with the other Cucumber modules, and points a `cucumber.object-factory` property at the replacement object factory. `cucumber-deltaspike` was removed without a replacement, so it is only flagged.",6,Cucumber-JVM,Cucumber,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber-JVM](https://github.com/cucumber/cucumber-jvm/).,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber](https://cucumber.io/).
 maven,org.openrewrite.recipe:rewrite-cucumber-jvm,org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.TypeRegistryConfigurerToAnnotations,Replace `TypeRegistryConfigurer` with cucumber-java annotations,"Cucumber-JVM 7.0.0 removed `TypeRegistryConfigurer`; replace implementations with `@ParameterType`, `@DataTableType`, `@DocStringType` and `@Default*Transformer` annotated glue methods. Classes whose `configureTypeRegistry` method cannot be converted in full are left untouched, with a `TODO` comment added above the registration that could not be converted.",1,Cucumber-JVM,Cucumber,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber-JVM](https://github.com/cucumber/cucumber-jvm/).,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber](https://cucumber.io/).
 maven,org.openrewrite.recipe:rewrite-cucumber-jvm,org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.UpgradeCucumber2x,Upgrade to Cucumber-JVM 2.x,Upgrade to Cucumber-JVM 2.x from any previous version.,23,Cucumber-JVM,Cucumber,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber-JVM](https://github.com/cucumber/cucumber-jvm/).,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber](https://cucumber.io/).
 maven,org.openrewrite.recipe:rewrite-cucumber-jvm,org.openrewrite.cucumber.jvm.UpgradeCucumber5x,Upgrade to Cucumber-JVM 5.x,Upgrade to Cucumber-JVM 5.x from any previous version.,63,Cucumber-JVM,Cucumber,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber-JVM](https://github.com/cucumber/cucumber-jvm/).,Recipes for upgrading [Cucumber](https://cucumber.io/).
